  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\nIt would be nice if the official docker image of synapse included [opencontainers-compatible labels](https://github.com/opencontainers/image-spec/blob/master/annotations.md). These can, for instance, be used by [renovate](https://github.com/renovatebot/renovate) to automatically fetch the changelog associated with new releases.\r\n",
